lobal.json` to .NET 10, which appears to be the one remaining instance in the repo that still refers to .NET 8\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAs our \"rollForward\" parameter pulls from the latest major version anyway, it's unlikely that most setups would run into issues, but it should prevent edge-cases where the wrong error is output if the only .NET available is less than 10\r\n\r\nAlso ensures that the \"version\" field uses the correct syntax[^1], as it turns out that the previous syntax might've not been appropriate in the first place? (should've been `8.0.100` instead of `8.0.0`)\r\n\r\n[^1]: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/tools/global-json#version","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/st